  "evidence": {
    "semantics": [
      "Register map, engine states and edge assignment were read from examples/soc_generation/rtl/novaspi.sv.",
      "SCK_HALF_DIV counts clk_i cycles per sck_o level, CS_SETUP the cycles cs_o is low before the first leading edge and CS_HOLD the cycles after the last one; these are the three timing facts src/myfuzz/protocols/rtl/soc_spi_peer.sv requires (each sck_i level >= 2 clk_i cycles, cs_i stable >= 1 cycle in each state)."
    ],
    "verified": [
      "Physical ports and widths come from verilator elaboration of the pinned novaspi.sv.",
      "The declared mode and timing are the elaboration parameters, so the master the composition renders is the master that was bound."
